Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PS hunting effort to make this cleanup
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.58,0:00:24.95,OP28 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}I grabbed hold, digging in my claws
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.58,0:00:24.95,OP28 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}te ni totte tsume o tateta
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.95,0:00:28.38,OP28 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}but the future
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.95,0:00:28.38,OP28 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}sono mirai wa
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.38,0:00:34.60,OP28 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}blurred together, colors running
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.38,0:00:34.60,OP28 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}nijimu iro ni kasunde mieta
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.60,0:00:41.20,OP28 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}A red that can swallow even summer's hues
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.60,0:00:41.20,OP28 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}natsu no iro mo nuritsubusu you na aka ni
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.30,0:00:47.92,OP28 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}now attempts to blot out our voices
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.30,0:00:47.92,OP28 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}bokura no koe kakikesareteiku you de
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.92,0:00:54.66,OP28 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}Move those halting feet of yours
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.92,0:00:54.66,OP28 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}tachidomaru sono ashi o fumidasou ze
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.66,0:01:01.30,OP28 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}Don't let stand the lies for show
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.66,0:01:01.30,OP28 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}misekake no uso yarisugosu yori
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.30,0:01:07.55,OP28 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}I'll give up countless mornings for my vows
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.30,0:01:07.55,OP28 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}nandome no asa chikai to hikikaeru yo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.55,0:01:16.10,OP28 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}For the dream that we shared
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.55,0:01:16.10,OP28 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur6}bokura ga miteita yume
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.75,0:01:35.87,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,2000)}The Height of Folly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.22,0:01:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All Marines, evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Board your ships now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what happened\Nat the center of the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just following orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,St.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saturn, Admiral Borsalino.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please retreat. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.74,0:02:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kizaru and I will remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Continue preparations without pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're through, commence bombardment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, you're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.78,0:02:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! You came to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill me thought all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of this be over once you accomplish that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spare the island with or without me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,egghead houses the latest research from
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every field of study in the world if\Nyou burn it down you'll set scientific
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,progress back a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Revoke the Buster Call, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Kizaru, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if there's something\Nelse you're hiding from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something troublesome for the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a risk we would be fools to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do not need your progress. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,behalf of all humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's something\NI neglected to mention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about that ship that\Nescaped the island yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've issued an order to have it pursued.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there might be people on board who learn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something about the Void\NSentry in their town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must ensure that none of them survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:04:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I sent a warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're innocent civilians!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the one who got\Nthem involved, Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You broke the law, just\Nas they did in Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could not save your lust for knowledge,\Nso you dug too deep into the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the beasts must remain on the\Nisland, marines to your ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as preparations are\Ncomplete, we'll commence our attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ship 54, ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ship 21, ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awaiting orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the vacuum rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know how long Vegapunk\Nwill be able to distract them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The meeting point is the rear\Nentrance of the Labophase.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be ready, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll leave as soon as everyone arrives!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what about Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get him out of here no sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, bro, and stay safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, it's Sanji. What's your status?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're already at the rear entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all the noise down there?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.24,0:05:54.65,Typeset things,,0,0,0,,{\fnA-OTF 新ゴ Pr6N R\fs55\bord2.4\blur0.6\pos(1645.26,417.22)\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}Labophase
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.24,0:05:54.65,Typeset things,,0,0,0,,{\fnA-OTF 新ゴ Pr6N R\fs55\bord0\blur0.6\pos(1645.26,417.22)\c&H030001&\4a&HFF&}Labophase
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.68,0:05:54.65,Typeset things,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1650,0)\fnA-OTF 新ゴ Pr6N R\fs50\bord2.4\blur0.6\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(231.39,847.86)\1a&HFF&\t(1605,1650,\1a&H00&)}Back\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\Nentrance
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.68,0:05:54.65,Typeset things,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1650,0)\fnA-OTF 新ゴ Pr6N R\fs50\bord0\blur0.6\c&H030001&\pos(231.39,847.86)\4a&HFF&}Back\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\Nentrance
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.97,0:05:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say Buster Call?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Buster Call was\Nalready too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to Stella?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, this is no time to\Nbe freaking out, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay calm like me and\Nwe'll all just run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just keep resting, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Franky and Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's fine and the rest are headed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your status over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of us are good, but Zoro's\Nstill getting held up by Lucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinbe is heading there now to go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way Zoro's finding his\Nway back without an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Brooke, he's supposed\Nto bring the Sunny around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lilith is there with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one tiny problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were going to have the Vega\NForce One carry the ship away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's not an option for us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Kizaru completely destroyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, then how are we supposed\Nto get off the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know, but\Napparently Brooke has a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing like a piping hot cup of tea while
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I effortlessly move our\Nship over the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I good or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby, Bones. Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll hit the\Nrear entrance in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freezing the island clouds and letting the\Nship slide on them was a work of genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming from the world's greatest genius,\NI dare say, that is some high praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, this is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how are we gonna\Nstop when we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I haven't thought\Nabout that part yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:07:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just gonna fall to our deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.72,0:08:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, Lil' Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better start thinking fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They still haven't brought\Nthe Labophase barrier down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All ships, the target\Nis Egghead's urban area!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Concentrate fire on the central\Nfactory and the future city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Begin the bombardment!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't got any seats yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pacifists are firing! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Preparing to depart febrile phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.94,0:09:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destination Lobby phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vacuum rocket, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I call speed! Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transit duration, 32 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amano Murakumo, sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Kizaru! Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pacifistas, fire on Bonnie and Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma sacrificed everything\Nto save his daughter's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now she'll be blown to\Nbits by one of his own clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly the height of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll feed him in for an insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie, when I heard that\Nyou had become a pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the first possible scenario\Nflashed through my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could not control what the\NNavy did with the Pacifistas,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,built in your father's likeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could be forced to shoot his own daughter\Nwithout understanding what he'd done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Straw Hat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, no more moving, Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capture him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an emperor of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They failed to destroy the escape vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone alert! Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him, our attackers,\Nthey're coming to Akainu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the battle's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess the newspaper had that part right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just digest all of that food?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we get too close, he might eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was human, but maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flames are closing in on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, then\Nwe're going down, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack on three!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be strong, but\Nwe'll stop him with C.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prism Stonecum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:13:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run to the ship! Go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had it down, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start from the shore\Nand burn it down! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.94,0:14:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Gomorrah! Bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atlas! Come in! I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot that fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his daughter, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must tell Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.22,0:14:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atlas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to escape from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that voice? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the hell can you hear\Nanything in all this noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd they turn around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the precipices have gone wrong. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That single fear tugged at my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you were killed by your own father
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Kuma, it's too cruel thinking that you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,might harm your daughter\Nwith your own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a tragedy I could\Nnot allow no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government didn't\Nknow but I programmed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something into every one of these weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with Kuma's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So take heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if he's given a command\Nby the highest authority in the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if everyone\Nand everything is against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie, Kuma will always,\Nalways be on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I selfishly made my wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how this would end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such decisions have\Nconsequences after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,VEGAPUNK!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,VEGAPUNK!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kizaru, eliminate them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kizaru! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't hurt, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:18:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll cut you both in half\Nnice and clean. Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full belly, full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're really having fun! Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bonnie, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it bouncing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got a bigger issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the path of faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,VEGAPUNK!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika is my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.68,0:19:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Nika comes, he'll smile and\Nlaugh, moving to this rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you didn't realize the truth about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be certain either,\Ntill I saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.96,0:20:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The very man Kuma placed his faith in,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat moving, who he watched so\Ncarefully, was Nika the sun gone all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma had it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the very start, the\NBuster Call is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there are people all over the\Nworld who have been waiting for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've waited for centuries.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:42.39,0:20:45.10,Typeset things,,0,0,0,,{\fnA-OTF UD新丸ゴ Pr6N R\fs70\b0\bord0\blur0.6\pos(1600.22,253.74)\c&H000000&}Northeast\Ncoast\N\NEgghead
