Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporting from the northeast coast,\NThere is a massive ship approaching us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them, without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they disbanded\Nover a hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we slow down? You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.22,0:20:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep her steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming right toward us! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.94,0:21:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are the Giants doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there they go again with\Ntheir why, why, why, Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't they know everything that happens\Nin this world is inevitable, Brogy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we're here\Nto back you up, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or should we call you Snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agency, the giant pirates are here!
