Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.68,0:22:30.76,ED22 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}Hey all you boys & girls! Looking good!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.68,0:22:30.76,ED22 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}soko no Boys & Girls! omae ii yatsu
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.76,0:22:34.31,ED22 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}Hey all you boys & girls!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.76,0:22:34.31,ED22 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}soko no Boys & Girls!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.15,0:22:38.28,ED22 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}Update failed. I've had enough!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.15,0:22:38.28,ED22 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}appudeto wa shippai kori gori
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.28,0:22:40.16,ED22 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}Wasn't it OK 'til yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.28,0:22:40.16,ED22 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}kinou made nara seikai?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.16,0:22:46.49,ED22 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}La la la la la la, run, run, run...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.16,0:22:46.49,ED22 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}ran ran ran ran ran ran Run Run Run
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.49,0:22:50.21,ED22 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}"Hiding yet?"
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.49,0:22:50.21,ED22 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}mou ii kai?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.21,0:22:52.58,ED22 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}You ready yet, up for a dance
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.21,0:22:52.58,ED22 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}junbi wa douyo odoreru no?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.58,0:22:54.95,ED22 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}in this broken era?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.58,0:22:54.95,ED22 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur7}bukkowareteru kono jidai
